Running the parametric studies

This assumes that the code and all of the utilities 
(timeextract, lineextract, puda) have been compiled.

__________________________________
Setup:
-  cd opt/StandAlone

-  Create a symbolic link to the orderAccuracy directory:
          make link_parametricStudies

-  Edit the components.xml file and uncomment the component you wish to test.
    vim parametricStudies/test_config_files/components.xml

- Create a .tst file for your test. This should be within, e.g., test_config_files/MPMICE 

- Place the ups file that you wish to use within that same directory

Run the tests:
-  parametricStudies/runTests

To examine the results look in the directory:
    ps_results/<component>/<test>
